kenization**":[25,30],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 1: Tokenization**#{1}":[27,30],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 2: Defining the Right Ontology**":[31,54],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 2: Defining the Right Ontology**#{1}":[33,40],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 2: Defining the Right Ontology**#**What’s an Ontology?**":[41,54],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 2: Defining the Right Ontology**#**What’s an Ontology?**#{1}":[43,54],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**![Defining-the-Right-Ontology-Graphic](https://auguria.io/hs-fs/hubfs/Defining-the-Right-Ontology-Graphic.webp?width=951&height=515&name=Defining-the-Right-Ontology-Graphic.webp)**":[55,56],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 3: Creating the embeddings**":[57,72],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 3: Creating the embeddings**#{1}":[59,72],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 4: Analyzing Vectors in Flatland**":[73,78],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 4: Analyzing Vectors in Flatland**#{1}":[75,78],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 5: Multidimensional vector analysis**":[79,92],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**Concept 5: Multidimensional vector analysis**#{1}":[81,92],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**The future vectors are bright**":[93,102],"#Why Your Next SIEM Will Analyze Vectors – Part 2##**The future vectors are bright**#{1}":[95,102]},"outlinks":[{"title":"first article in this series","target":"https://auguria.io/insights/why-your-next-siem-will-analyze-vectors/","line":21},{"title":"Defining-the-Right-Ontology-Graphic","target":"https://auguria.io/hs-fs/hubfs/Defining-the-Right-Ontology-Graphic.webp?width=951&height=515&name=Defining-the-Right-Ontology-Grap